arm's length price so determined and price at which the international transaction or specified domestic transaction has actually been
undertaken does not exceed such percentage not exceeding 3% of the latter, notified by the Central Government in this behalf; or
(b) in case, more than one price is determined by the most appropriate method, the price determined in such manner as may be prescribed.

